{"unit_id":"liaoyonghong__dsh-workspace-api#card-zh","repo":"liaoyonghong/dsh-workspace-api","commit":"6bc8d39b1bb524d8bbc2da57c934bfa73f54f496","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-api 是面向 DSH Web 的工作区 HTTP 接口插件，将路由注册到 DSH GUI 所在服务。它提供工作区列表、目录清单与目录树、按文件名搜索、读取文本和下载原始文件，并可把自然语言任务排入队列交给 headless DSH 处理。调用方可通过 HTTP 查询任务状态或等待结果，适合把 DSH 工作区能力接入内部应用和自动化流程。运行需要 DSH Web 与 dsh 命令；可设置工作区根目录、任务超时、队列上限和可选访问令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:331-389","lib/index.js:400-413"]}
{"unit_id":"liaoyonghong__dsh-workspace-api#card-en","repo":"liaoyonghong/dsh-workspace-api","commit":"6bc8d39b1bb524d8bbc2da57c934bfa73f54f496","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-workspace-api lets DSH Web clients browse workspaces, search and read files, and submit natural-language tasks to headless DSH. Callers can fetch task results or status. It connects internal apps to DSH. Requires DSH Web and dsh; root, timeout, queue size, and optional token are configurable.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:331-389","lib/index.js:400-413"]}
