{"unit_id":"liaoyonghong__dsh-workspace-api#feature-1","repo":"liaoyonghong/dsh-workspace-api","commit":"6bc8d39b1bb524d8bbc2da57c934bfa73f54f496","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-api 的功能「工作区列表与目录浏览」：提供工作区列表、目录项清单和限深目录树，供 HTTP 客户端查看可访问的工作区结构。 通过 /workspace-api 对应端点触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:331-350"]}
{"unit_id":"liaoyonghong__dsh-workspace-api#feature-2","repo":"liaoyonghong/dsh-workspace-api","commit":"6bc8d39b1bb524d8bbc2da57c934bfa73f54f496","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-api 的功能「按名称搜索文件」：客户端提交 q 查询后，接口递归查找名称匹配的文件或目录，并返回相对路径和基本信息。 通过 /workspace-api 对应端点触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:233-256"]}
{"unit_id":"liaoyonghong__dsh-workspace-api#feature-3","repo":"liaoyonghong/dsh-workspace-api","commit":"6bc8d39b1bb524d8bbc2da57c934bfa73f54f496","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-api 的功能「读取或下载文件」：通过 read 返回文本内容或文件摘要信息，也可用 raw 获取文件字节，支持文本截断上限。 通过 /workspace-api 对应端点触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:258-303"]}
